flowchart TD
    A[workflow_template 信封] --> B[Splicer 拼接器]
    B -->|"system(插值+RAG)→ history → user"| C[ModelRequest.messages]
    C --> D{Hook: pre_model_call}
    D --> E[ModelClient]
    E -->|"OpenAI 兼容 /v1/chat/completions"| F[模型回复 JSON]
    F --> G{Hook: post_model_call}
    G --> H[Translator 翻译器]
    H -->|type=text / empty| I["收尾: final_answer"]
    H -->|type=tool_calls| J{Hook: pre_dispatch}
    J --> K[Dispatcher 分发器]
    K -->|local| L[本地工具 @tool]
    K -->|mcp:<server>| M[MCP 服务]
    K -->|not found| N[ToolResult ok=False]
    L --> O[ToolResult ok=True]
    M --> O
    N --> P{Hook: post_dispatch}
    O --> P
    P --> Q["回填 tool 消息 → transcript → 下一轮"]
    Q --> B
    I --> R[RunResult status=final]
